% expect-output: 0.5
% expect-output: 0.0
% expect-output: 0.5
% expect-output: 3
% Scenario: components are clamped to their range without error (PLRM3
% Table 4.6, RangeA). A component above the range reads back as the
% maximum, one below as the minimum; a range that excludes zero gives
% the nearest valid initial colour; setcolor consumes exactly the
% family's components.
[/CIEBasedA << /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089] /RangeA [0 0.5] >>] setcolorspace
2 setcolor currentcolor ==
-1 setcolor currentcolor ==
[/CIEBasedA << /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089] /RangeA [0.5 1] >>] setcolorspace
currentcolor ==
1 2 3 [/CIEBasedABC << /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089] >>] setcolorspace
0.1 0.2 0.3 setcolor count ==
